# Payments testing

- Never mock the database in integration tests under `src/payments/`. The reconciliation logic
  depends on Postgres advisory locks, and a mocked session hides every deadlock this code can hit.
- Claude runs the payments integration suite with `make test-integration -- tests/integration/payments`.
- Claude keeps the Stripe SDK itself stubbed, because the test account rate-limits.
